{"id":"n14140-1-7","stage":3,"title":"오래도록 · 久久","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14140-1-7-1","ko":"우리 같이 사진 찍을래?","zh":"我们要不要一起拍张照片？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"같이","meaning":"一同，一块儿，共同","explanation":"같이：一同，一块儿，共同。","readings":[{"term":"같이","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26799","senseId":"2","lemma":"같이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같이","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3"}},{"text":"사진","meaning":"照片，相片","explanation":"사진：照片，相片。","readings":[{"term":"사진","audio":"/audio/1f872b5045690a7e3f16.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28030","senseId":"1","lemma":"사진","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사진","audio":"/audio/1f872b5045690a7e3f16.mp3"}},{"text":"찍을래?","meaning":"拍，拍摄","explanation":"찍다：拍，拍摄；을래：非敬语地表达意愿或询问对方意愿。","readings":[{"term":"찍다","audio":"/audio/e1e4a898170582452675.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63320","senseId":"6","lemma":"찍다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찍을래","audio":"/audio/c756c4d7eb635961a58f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"d44da011993f2a6e","term":"같이","zh":"一同，一块儿，共同","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3","entryId":"26799","definition":"和某物或某人一起。","pronunciation":["가치"]},{"id":"1f872b5045690a7e","term":"사진","zh":"照片，相片","audio":"/audio/1f872b5045690a7e3f16.mp3","entryId":"28030","definition":"为将事物的样子长久保存下来而用照相机拍下后在纸或电脑等上显现出的影像。","pronunciation":["사진"]},{"id":"e1e4a89817058245","term":"찍다","zh":"拍，拍摄","audio":"/audio/e1e4a898170582452675.mp3","entryId":"63320","definition":"用照相机照射某个物品，把其样子移动到胶片上。","pronunciation":["찍따"]}],"audio":"/audio/9c6708491e0255139b9f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14140-1-7-2","ko":"그래, 좋아. 너랑 찍은 사진은 오래도록 간직할게.","zh":"好啊，当然。和你一起拍的照片我会好好保存很久的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래,","meaning":"好吧，是","explanation":"그래：好吧，是。","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}},{"text":"좋아.","meaning":"行，可以","explanation":"좋다：行，可以；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"12","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋아","audio":"/audio/03b87f7121c91d1c28e1.mp3"}},{"text":"너랑","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너랑","audio":"/audio/32c7250ffa53acbc7ea0.mp3"}},{"text":"찍은","meaning":"拍，拍摄","explanation":"찍다：拍，拍摄；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"찍다","audio":"/audio/e1e4a898170582452675.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63320","senseId":"6","lemma":"찍다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찍은","audio":"/audio/4a002e41a75fe18b2d06.mp3"}},{"text":"사진은","meaning":"照片，相片","explanation":"사진：照片，相片；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"사진","audio":"/audio/1f872b5045690a7e3f16.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28030","senseId":"1","lemma":"사진","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사진은","audio":"/audio/727899a8ceefd98d868c.mp3"}},{"text":"오래도록","meaning":"久久，好久好久","explanation":"오래도록：久久，好久好久。","readings":[{"term":"오래도록","audio":"/audio/bd69b89bb17219c91441.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14140","senseId":"1","lemma":"오래도록","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오래도록","audio":"/audio/bd69b89bb17219c91441.mp3"}},{"text":"간직할게.","meaning":"珍藏，铭记，珍惜","explanation":"간직하다：珍藏，铭记，珍惜；ㄹ게：向对方表达说话人的决定或承诺，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"간직하다","audio":"/audio/02a539933850f93814ac.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14167","senseId":"2","lemma":"간직하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"간직할게","audio":"/audio/383eb05b3c1fe11cc2c9.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d39087dda3899d88","term":"그래","zh":"好吧，是","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3","entryId":"27656","definition":"用于回答，表示“会那样做，是那样的，知道了”等肯定的含义。","pronunciation":["그래"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"行，可以","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"某个行动或事情等不成问题。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"e1e4a89817058245","term":"찍다","zh":"拍，拍摄","audio":"/audio/e1e4a898170582452675.mp3","entryId":"63320","definition":"用照相机照射某个物品，把其样子移动到胶片上。","pronunciation":["찍따"]},{"id":"1f872b5045690a7e","term":"사진","zh":"照片，相片","audio":"/audio/1f872b5045690a7e3f16.mp3","entryId":"28030","definition":"为将事物的样子长久保存下来而用照相机拍下后在纸或电脑等上显现出的影像。","pronunciation":["사진"]},{"id":"bd69b89bb17219c9","term":"오래도록","zh":"久久，好久好久","audio":"/audio/bd69b89bb17219c91441.mp3","entryId":"14140","definition":"经过相当长的时间。","pronunciation":["오래도록"]},{"id":"02a539933850f938","term":"간직하다","zh":"珍藏，铭记，珍惜","audio":"/audio/02a539933850f93814ac.mp3","entryId":"14167","definition":"心中深深地带着记忆或回忆等。","pronunciation":["간지카다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b77f282d2e65c58ac363.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.831,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14140","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","licens